{"id":"d20e58bb8f65e2eb","group":"29","path":"29/29-ex-datalog-tc.md","title":"Datalog 计算非空路径闭包","display":"ex-datalog-tc — Datalog 计算非空路径闭包","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-ex-datalog-tc","aliases":["29-ex-datalog-tc"],"display":"ex-datalog-tc — Datalog 计算非空路径闭包","depends_on":["[[29-df-datalog]]","[[29-df-tc]]"],"source_locator":"Query14.11, p.225, scan240","source_basis":"扫描240原图；与本库反身TC接口的差异显式化，并给出本地证明"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-ex-datalog-tc"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-ex-datalog-tc</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-datalog-tc — Datalog 计算非空路径闭包"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"533aac05e72771cc\" href=\"?note=533aac05e72771cc\" title=\"29-df-datalog\">29-df-datalog</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e0bc79e14d83be0f\" href=\"?note=e0bc79e14d83be0f\" title=\"29-df-tc\">29-df-tc</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Query14.11, p.225, scan240"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"扫描240原图；与本库反身TC接口的差异显式化，并给出本地证明"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(V,E)\">\\(M=(V,E)\\)</span> 是非空有限有向图，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq V^2\">\\(E\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>；词汇为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau=\\langle E^{(2)}\\rangle\">\\(\\tau=\\langle E^{(2)}\\rangle\\)</span>。新关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 为二元，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y,z\">\\(x,y,z\\)</span> 为不同变量。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ans}_{D,1}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ans}_{D,1}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"533aac05e72771cc\" href=\"?note=533aac05e72771cc\" title=\"29-df-datalog\">29-df-datalog</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TC}_V\">\\(\\operatorname{TC}_V\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e0bc79e14d83be0f\" href=\"?note=e0bc79e14d83be0f\" title=\"29-df-tc\">29-df-tc</a> 的反身传递闭包。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_+\">\\(D_+\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E^+\">\\(E^+\\)</span> 在下式构造。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"D_+\\coloneqq\\{(A(x,y),(A(x,z),A(z,y))),(A(x,y),(E(x,y)))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[D_+\\coloneqq\\{(A(x,y),(A(x,z),A(z,y))),(A(x,y),(E(x,y)))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"E^+\\coloneqq\\{(u,v)\\in V^2\\mid\\exists l\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\;\\exists(w_0,\\ldots,w_l)\\in V^{l+1}\\;(w_0=u\\land w_l=v\\land\\forall i&lt;l\\;(w_i,w_{i+1})\\in E)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[E^+\\coloneqq\\{(u,v)\\in V^2\\mid\\exists l\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\;\\exists(w_0,\\ldots,w_l)\\in V^{l+1}\\;(w_0=u\\land w_l=v\\land\\forall i&lt;l\\;(w_i,w_{i+1})\\in E)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ans}_{D_+,1}(M)=E^+,\\qquad\\operatorname{TC}_V(E)=\\{(v,v)\\mid v\\in V\\}\\cup E^+.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ans}_{D_+,1}(M)=E^+,\\qquad\\operatorname{TC}_V(E)=\\{(v,v)\\mid v\\in V\\}\\cup E^+.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书的两条规则并没有空路径基例，故其直接输出是长度至少为一的路径关系；有向环可使部分对角元组出现，但不能据此得到全部对角线。本库 TC 采用反身约定，使用时必须补上恒等关系。</p>\n<p>每个生成元组都对应一条边或两条已有非空路径的拼接，因此答案包含于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E^+\">\\(E^+\\)</span>。反过来按路径长度归纳：长度一由第二条规则生成，长度大于一分解为一条边与更短路径，由第一条规则在有限轮后生成。因而其最小规则封闭关系恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E^+\">\\(E^+\\)</span>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-datalog","status":"resolved","id":"533aac05e72771cc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-datalog]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-tc","status":"resolved","id":"e0bc79e14d83be0f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-tc]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-datalog","status":"resolved","id":"533aac05e72771cc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Ans}_{D,1}$ 使用 [[29-df-datalog]]；$\\operatorname{TC}_V$ 使用 [[29-df-tc]] 的反身传递闭包。$D_+$、$E^+$ 在下式构造。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-tc","status":"resolved","id":"e0bc79e14d83be0f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Ans}_{D,1}$ 使用 [[29-df-datalog]]；$\\operatorname{TC}_V$ 使用 [[29-df-tc]] 的反身传递闭包。$D_+$、$E^+$ 在下式构造。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"M=(V,E)","display":false},{"tex":"E\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau=\\langle E^{(2)}\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"x,y,z","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ans}_{D,1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TC}_V","display":false},{"tex":"D_+","display":false},{"tex":"E^+","display":false},{"tex":"D_+\\coloneqq\\{(A(x,y),(A(x,z),A(z,y))),(A(x,y),(E(x,y)))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"E^+\\coloneqq\\{(u,v)\\in V^2\\mid\\exists l\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\;\\exists(w_0,\\ldots,w_l)\\in V^{l+1}\\;(w_0=u\\land w_l=v\\land\\forall i<l\\;(w_i,w_{i+1})\\in E)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ans}_{D_+,1}(M)=E^+,\\qquad\\operatorname{TC}_V(E)=\\{(v,v)\\mid v\\in V\\}\\cup E^+.","display":true},{"tex":"E^+","display":false},{"tex":"E^+","display":false}],"bytes":1706,"backlinks":[{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-142","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-datalog]]、[[29-ex-datalog-tc]] — Datalog / Datalog* 最小模型及非空路径闭包"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-153","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-ex-datalog-tc]]"},{"id":"ef134b4589bf7f20","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-ex-datalog-tc|29-ex-datalog-tc]]"}],"outgoing":["533aac05e72771cc","e0bc79e14d83be0f"]}